    "Are there any limits on how many units of each component can be produced (such as maximum demand per component, storage capacity, or a cap on total units), or can each component be produced in unlimited quantities as long as workshop hours are available?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding production limits versus unlimited production, framed as a binary choice."
}

